{"id":"wb-7-1552","name":"香泉寺石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"香泉寺石窟","text":"香泉寺石窟位于中华人民共和国河南省卫辉市太公镇霖落山香泉寺内，是一处以佛教石窟、摩崖刻经和造像等为主体的石窟寺及石刻遗存，为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。香泉寺内现存南北朝至清代的多项古迹遗存，包括北齐时期的佛教刻经和造像，以及其后历代增刻的佛龛、石塔、碑刻及题记等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E6%B3%89%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94754386,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94754386","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4b58b97456357c1905fba808.jpg","title":"20260825_Xiangquan_Temple_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260825_Xiangquan_Temple_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/20260825_Xiangquan_Temple_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南卫辉 香泉寺石窟","width":320,"height":213}}